yle=\"font-family:tahoma;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#006400;\">SUGAR GROVE, Ill. ---</span> </strong>Following a 7-0 setback in the opener of its non-conference doubleheader against Waubonsee Monday afternoon, the Prairie State baseball team bounced back nicely by way of a 12-2 victory in the nightcap.</span>","type":null,"byline":"Chris Kuchta ","app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"Baseball","sport":{"id":1,"title":"Baseball","abbreviation":"BB","shortname":"baseball","short_title":null,"global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"baseball","gender":"m","youtube":"","facebook":null,"twitter":null,"instagram":null,"pinterest":null,"tickets":null,"global_sport_name_slug":null,"url":null,"ranking":null,"game_synonym":null},"sport_shortname":null,"image_source":"/images/2026/3/31/MOISES_VAZQUEZ_FOR_WEBSITE.jpg","image_focal_point":null,"image_alt_text":"Moises Vazquez vs Kish '26","video":null,"url":"/news/2026/3/31/baseball-16-hit-attack-in-nightcap-powers-psc-to-split-with-waubonsee.aspx","redirect_absolute_url":null,"links":null,"homepage_feed_template":"story_links","game_id":null,"games":[],"gallery_id":0,"writer":null,"ranking":5,"locked_ranking":false,"id":774,"content_id":"774","content_title":"16-Hit Attack in Nightcap Powers PSC to Split With Waubonsee","content_date":"2026-03-31T14:30:00","content_url":"https://prairiestateathletics.com/news/2026/3/31/baseball-16-hit-attack-in-nightcap-powers-psc-to-split-with-waubonsee.aspx","content_image_url":"https://prairiestateathletics.com/images/2026/3/31/MOISES_VAZQUEZ_FOR_WEBSITE.jpg","date":"2026-03-31T14:30:00"},{"title":"Pioneers Go 3-1 Over Productive Weekend, Even Record at .500","title_in_rotator":true,"sub_headline":null,"teaser":"<span style=\"font-family:tahoma;\"><span style=\"color:#006400;\"><strong>CHICAGO HEIGHTS, Ill. --- </strong></span>After a grueling spring trip, which saw it battle several high-caliber programs, many of whom had played 15 or more ga